From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:10:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: apple_tristar_charger: support calibrated
 D2355 input

Integrate the retained J120 Tristar backend and guarded probe cleanup. Use the tested attachment predicate and the August ADC. Withdraw to fallback on pack-read failure and clear unsampled cable details.

Assisted-by: LLM
